{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "8d690487e5d9238b16e5b8a96123c994a498dd13e76b0bda74d20e88d2382289", "ja": "やっほー、{$P$}！\nアタシに用があるって言ってたけどどうしたの？", "zh": "呀吼，{$P$}！\n你之前说找我有事，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bd4377196d6f6d9cba3fb298f459a985d052e0af5f1b26126ff71722838c5503", "ja": "お疲れさま、のり子！　初公演も終わったことだし、\n今後の活動について話をしようと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，纪子！首场公演也结束了，本来想和你聊聊今后的活动，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "872b82804d8c76733df573265cc6171021129a14b7c6ac5064b54ee505ac8789", "ja": "アイドルとして、将来的にやってみたいこととか\nあるか？　格闘技関係とは聞いてるけど……。", "zh": "作为偶像，你将来有没有想尝试做的事情？\n我听说是和格斗技有关，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "eea3a39679a16c2ec7705a3df9eb1a2ad107d967a0182258e8996b7af367f146", "ja": "えへへっ、そのとおり！\nその中でも一番やってみたいのは、キャスターかな？", "zh": "嘿嘿，没错！  \n在那些事情里，我最想尝试的还是担任解说员吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "e57fcdf10e17c04d212c1f5eea9c9aec881184513a7be335394a2aa9b6334b8b", "ja": "リングサイドで、ヘッドセットして試合を解説するの！\nくぅ～っ、憧れるよね～！", "zh": "在擂台边戴上耳机解说比赛！\n呜～真让人憧憬啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "367a8475a2028c5b8e9769e92c63ac61e1e727ed82369cc138421381aa45bf80", "ja": "アタシ、普段から試合を観に行ってるし、雑誌なんかも\nチェックしてるから。けっこう向いてると思うんだ♪", "zh": "我平时就经常去看比赛，也会关注杂志之类的。我觉得自己还挺适合做这个的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "08013a9226df522fae2c3b8f4541cc2a8297035d8a80287d4a00130d7cb11774", "ja": "そうか、はっきりした目標があるなら話は早い。\n将来そういう仕事ができる方向で、考えてみるか！", "zh": "这样啊，既然你有明确的目标，那就好办了。  \n那就朝着将来能做这类工作的方向，考虑看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "d18d37b1a6b65782dd08473eb8f91ff402e70b2ceab70c11ca793fcd49737491", "ja": "ホント！？　やったー！\nあこがれの格闘技のお仕事だー！！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了！\n是我一直憧憬的格斗技工作——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "1c8797d37395290dc31b1e63b12aac124228701e210935c36cb49476faba2cfe", "ja": "ふっふっふー。帰ったら兄貴に自慢してやろうっと！\n絶対、うらやましがるぞ～。", "zh": "哼哼哼～。回去后一定要向哥哥炫耀一下！\n他绝对会羡慕得不得了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eee71837878adb2fba6f63092a5eabd5ed0b5cbbb066de8c9724ba2b203bc16c", "ja": "はは、気が早いな。\nしかし、のり子は本当に格闘技が好きなんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，真心急啊。\n不过，看来你是真的很喜欢格斗技呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "85668532b1b9d2b64365386143580e0f17e04a197eb5c1d483f6e12a143e5049", "ja": "うん！　小さいころ、\n兄貴と一緒にTVを観てたからかな？　自然とね。", "zh": "嗯！可能是因为小时候经常和哥哥一起看电视吧？不知不觉就喜欢上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "16f1aa138f6f40e128642782d39fc7dadc45597cf2bec786c99a1d3e756da106", "ja": "選手がガッツリ組み合ってるところを観るとさ、こう、\n熱くなるっていうか……応援しちゃうんだよね！", "zh": "看到选手们激烈地缠抱在一起，就会觉得，怎么说呢……热血沸腾起来，忍不住就给他们加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "c045362856ca4345fb84a0424a617d0a99532f6f271c02874d151b58f0bcb1a6", "ja": "アドレナリン全開！って感じで。\nTVを観た後は、よく兄貴とプロレスごっこしたな～。", "zh": "简直就是肾上腺素全开！的感觉。\n看完电视后，我经常会和哥哥玩摔跤游戏呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1013_p", "source_sha256": "487950985da3f567186bb0e10ce952c6351f8906946f318751630d09dc8efcd8", "ja": "そうか、やんちゃな女の子だったんだな。\nもっとも、お兄さんも手加減したんだろうけど……。", "zh": "原来你以前是个调皮的女孩子啊。\n不过，你哥哥应该也手下留情了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "5ec4bddfa5ed995deda6fdc0ab97df4790272b6ea58010ad7941bb27b810c160", "ja": "そんなコトないよ！　全然、ぜーんぜんだよ！？\nアタシ、1回も勝てなかったもん！", "zh": "才不是那样呢！完全不是，真的完全不是！我可是连赢1次都没做到过啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "c732a3371a9d894814d784ee506a4690ce0a285d6e3c452e15fbb85eefc8cc24", "ja": "でも、アタシも大人になったし。\n今ならいい勝負ができるかも……。", "zh": "不过，我也长大了嘛。\n现在的话，说不定能旗鼓相当地比一场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1016_p", "source_sha256": "18d162531d5f9652f5090e392594e21551e1fc20748023a27800d522426cc30b", "ja": "どうした？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "cab6bf2b29cf781e5d758ec3be61edc69bd3d4fe5d72fcbb151a27af90851e8b", "ja": "そういえば{$P$}って、\n兄貴と雰囲気が似てるね。背格好も同じくらい……？", "zh": "说起来，{$P$}和我哥哥的感觉很像呢。身材个头也差不多……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "23bce3390d9dc9de0eae834b1dfbcac8bd5e3d127c51cae5501684cba6ffe502", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}！\nちょっと技かけてみてもいい！？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！\n我可以稍微对你使个招吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "688c408d60842f344a30def6eaed21506ea9bf71d8768cc3dde49fb0117674e5", "ja": "な、なんでいきなりそんな話になるんだ？", "zh": "为、为什么突然说起这种事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "55fc4cdc0b04c44c5c00dbd07d867762625241b6acba1ff163db92e330fc6070", "ja": "いやー、昔の話をしてたらウズウズしてきちゃって！\nね、いいでしょ？　ちょっとだけだから♪", "zh": "哎呀，聊起以前的事，我就有点按捺不住了嘛！\n呐，就一下下，可以的吧？♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c1fbb7c386c351baef23278130b1dc4448bb1b43cc4c920ce207a39c9475395f", "ja": "ま、待てのり子！\n待っ……うわあああああ！？", "zh": "等、等一下法子！\n等……哇啊啊啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1022_se", "source_sha256": "900b377c99fbadbfcb3c3d1d192bc7c15d03d3b1a8d9b054c32e4699a133c5d8", "ja": "ボキ、ボキボキボキッ！", "zh": "咔、咔咔咔咔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "346a7e9425503b2063815ee6b75065a3f0786c6da397032b3c7afda1e2de2bf7", "ja": "（……結局、いくつも技をかけられてしまった。\n聞いてはいけない音を、何度か聞いた気がするぞ……）", "zh": "（……结果还是被使了好几个招式。\n总觉得听到了几次不该听到的声音……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "6ce01078b10478b3eb2a173b8e8efc3d023b2a7505cc101efe29a4af5693bc51", "ja": "あ、あはは、やりすぎちゃったかな……？\nごめんね、{$P$}。怒ってる？", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈，好像有点做过头了……？\n对不起，{$P$}。你生气了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5a4b0e661ce1cd2082551940963ccd4367e9a0dfb53eb7926e83ba61a4f41f83", "ja": "いや、逆に感心したよ。\nあれだけの技を出せるなんて、大したもんだ。", "zh": "不，我反而很佩服呢。\n能使出那么厉害的招式，真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "55b5f33dcca1fcc656ffcf04e86006cd14e8260ef7b9a25c27d911b6dce2c361", "ja": "けど、単純に格闘技が好きなだけじゃ、\n仕事には繋がらないかもしれないな……。", "zh": "不过，如果只是单纯喜欢格斗技，可能也没办法和工作联系起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "9b9a59a75b7160371ea65be8de7e354f59ac82ed939962dcf1ec5c729889f3bf", "ja": "えっ、そうなの！？\nなんで、どうして{$P$}！", "zh": "咦，是这样吗！？为什么，怎么会这样，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c9613198af66c9784dad11d54655b64c1d59525e6cd1f225733ed68dc0826c4e", "ja": "格闘技ファンの女の子じゃダメなんだ。アイドルが\n格闘技を好き、だからみんなが興味を持つ……。", "zh": "不能只是喜欢格斗的女孩子。要是偶像喜欢格斗，大家也会因此产生兴趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "42e838a25b34bcc8026844b7e0bdfd417bdd9c61d474e1a251d8da1307874094", "ja": "うっ！　た、たしかに……。", "zh": "呜！确实……是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9bb015ffcd0415bac7c7fbf76ff037d14698197bdd8a6f09d2f6b24e71be7f55", "ja": "だから……まずは、みんなが夢中になってくれる、\nそんなアイドルになれるように頑張ろう！", "zh": "所以……首先，努力成为能让大家为之着迷的偶像吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "36925c6be4cc26f812c1e0b1b2875efa7461aa15926b1e9d67001ca9349bb339", "ja": "そっか……そうだよね。\nただの女の子のアタシじゃ、誰も興味ないよね。", "zh": "这样啊……确实是呢。\n如果只是普通女孩的我，谁都不会感兴趣吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f520d35d351833e1587f239123c018e23fb3636fa69d60f1b263e42dcbc1ca0", "ja": "ちゃんと一人前のアイドルとして、\nみんなを盛り上げられるようにならないと！", "zh": "作为一名真正出色的偶像，必须变得能够带动大家的气氛才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1033_p", "source_sha256": "fbdf169a0f7ae66391a762d0a348c1a416b8fa3ce86f20b2e7ee027f0e76d05b", "ja": "そういうことだ。", "zh": "就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "b8cf75fff22ccb46ca3505312fbd1fe52e6f2feb437c0baa9eab46abaf9b1ddb", "ja": "オッケー、{$P$}！\nそのためにも、まずはレッスンかな？", "zh": "好，{$P$}！\n为此，首先得进行训练吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "9d44987a8e5804e379a0baeee9e8575ca035d9837c180afdffcddcdab3800bde", "ja": "だからキャスターのお仕事、よろしくね♪\nよーしっ、頑張るぞー！　おーっ！", "zh": "所以，解说员的工作就拜托你啦♪\n好——！加油吧——！噢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_043nor_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_004_1036_p", "source_sha256": "1975d149bbf54521f7d3783d0ca4b6487c6012acca04fa2e59c50b8710ddfedb", "ja": "（今すぐじゃなくてもいい。少しずつ、選手と\nトレーナーのように、二人三脚で進んでいこう！）", "zh": "（不必非得现在。就像选手和教练一样，今后也一起一步一个脚印地走下去吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
